#: scenario6:scenario6_DFCA190C_9381_49EB_AF34_7594F696866E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3930d3bf3648649a0fd99d21a629abca65173fef7c4472d7fa4bc05cd9fdbad
