msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_DFCA190C_9381_49EB_AF34_7594F696866E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫something changed for the very first time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫lorsque quelque chose changea pour la toute première fois."

#: scenario6:scenario6_A17834CC_C534_4890_9DF7_B42A8279E7D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 41865eba9648cbae6c0f6c73032d61be22aad0f5a6fca28e9efb15c3c7c8a6d1
#. default-sha256: ef2158850e7b334703e20940173384fa9711c583620f74341886612caa824fa1
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_A17834CC_C534_4890_9DF7_B42A8279E7D2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Sunlight, which I had not seen in all that time, shone in from outside."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La lumière du soleil, que je n’avais pas vue depuis tout ce temps, éclaira les fenêtres et "
"illumina le manoir."

#: scenario6:scenario6_B5740C44_6B5C_4BB8_A2B1_5BAB28C78E13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e3a355cfec61e496127d25b876593b10be29252eb0a568eec14da6494f3473bc
#. default-sha256: 672bddf956e1aca24a3e038b5ba1a7781359bfd5a76d156a796b7ae156552433
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_B5740C44_6B5C_4BB8_A2B1_5BAB28C78E13"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At first, I did not believe it was real. ⟪k:1⟫I thought it was a hallucination born of my "
"inner desires."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Au début, je ne croyais pas que c’était réel. ⟪k:1⟫Je pensais que c’était une hallucination "
"créée par mes désirs les plus profonds."

#: scenario6:scenario6_3B8290BF_A1FD_477C_9A25_BDDA5A48F678
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f1e97555ac5844376ccf888e80135a28bfbdcb7508b9bd7783aafeb0680af4cd
#. default-sha256: a8e82438c008b90a1f496205fcd2e40c40fce33a88193640552722aad5e2f11c
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_3B8290BF_A1FD_477C_9A25_BDDA5A48F678"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I thought I must have completely lost it for my fantasies to have escaped my mind."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et je pensais que je devais avoir perdu complètement l’esprit pour que mes fantasmes "
"deviennent réalité."

#: scenario6:scenario6_E0EFF0B0_F4EC_4C86_8C4E_09D63CF82B05
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d1b55b92df30aad542568a9cc45e5530000b25d13a4f9f0705b5e4437781f59
