msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The time has come, Giselle.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It’s time for you to get to work."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il est l’heure, Giselle.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Il est temps que tu te mettes au travail."

#: scenario6:scenario6_34F6CBFA_78F3_45B3_8F31_59CFF12DE53C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d113e5cc7f0b6f81a66607697ebf8572fd796eb918240d4943ed37ab5c02c81
