msgid "⟪k:0⟫Reveling in the sight of the outside was the last thing I should have been doing,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je n’aurais jamais dû me réjouir de voir l’extérieur"

#: scenario6:scenario6_80F86752_F15F_4301_8AE2_C505E3FD8C04
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c356db4368e90de482dd2980c644d02728594a5d0351a7cccc489e22c12f641c
