msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A-⟪k:1⟫Attendez !⟪k:2⟫Je-⟪k:3⟫Je n’ai aucune idée de ce que je suis censée faire..."

#: scenario6:scenario6_DC709350_7D43_4641_94B4_BD278118B4B0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68afbe27530099350ab7d70fdbca807f0e8fdeb10d887d54ffaf8972ba5869e2
