msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_DC709350_7D43_4641_94B4_BD278118B4B0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Do the same thing you have been doing—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫be a maid.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Convince the house’s "
"guests that this is a wonderful place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Fais la même chose que d’habitude—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ comporte-toi en servante.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Convaincs "
"les hôtes de la maison que c’est un merveilleux endroit."

#: scenario6:scenario6_7F6217C6_D418_4F30_BA21_F95C9C9613D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b410a4be477be6bf072179c9a0127c9226b26a30b62edf1e5a733036b1036f12
