msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Mais est-ce que la porte va... ⟪k:1⟫s’ouvrir ?)"

#: scenario6:scenario6_C4E828DB_696C_4F5D_9A09_04597E774214
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f583fbb86b95bbf09b68f52f50aa1d0c8241de08e5f27b893f97505ee7f9b6e
#. default-sha256: fa26fe22a12ee290c635a22274dab85b39f94f4ab6ce0320b37682e0be0e095f
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_C4E828DB_696C_4F5D_9A09_04597E774214"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫For so long, the door had refused to budge.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫For so long, light had forsaken "
"these halls.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫For so long, there had been no trace of life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Cela faisait si longtemps que la porte avait refusé de bouger.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Cela faisait si "
"longtemps que la lumière avait abandonné ces lieux.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Cela faisait si longtemps qu’il n’y "
"avait plus eu aucune trace de vie."

#: scenario6:scenario6_D2037F95_74B5_451B_A296_F78BD0F5D9DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c615207dc6ae240f033aae85e0e3b96fa8f3d2f0ab1c4291391f5383d39f0a7
#. default-sha256: 2230a1f2ac19130354ffbe7a17884af4574b0dd24843262fd52ff59e801d1387
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D2037F95_74B5_451B_A296_F78BD0F5D9DC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And now, all of that had been turned on its head."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et à présent, cela changeait du tout au tout."

#: scenario6:scenario6_48D2F6F0_DB1E_47E7_BCE8_38526208AA81
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63b4a484066eb1220dca491930b52769b4f7886eb011f083a941f2a8b6b8e6d4
