msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was a single chef, a physician, a servant to take care of all the cleaning, and then "
"me, who served as his personal assistant."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il n’y avait qu’un seul chef de cuisine, un médecin, un serviteur pour s’occuper du "
"nettoyage, et moi, qui lui servais d’assistante personnelle."

#: scenario6:scenario6_2544CC8E_7C46_4D70_B2BC_2F88E3822C84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b90c9ffa449d45ccadf774c6f449125ac32105f5f7480535183476c7590bf3d
